      "value": "Thank. You. ive been saying this for AGES. and i can find basically -no one- that agreed. I love the quest version of the game, its my main version to play since i dont have a poweful pc. and while its nice, how the vrchat team handled the ranking system has seriously dissapointed me. especially very poor avatars. they hurt literally everyone with a very disgusting up side.",
